   "title": "Nehru’s contributions to build modern India immense: Padmaraj Poojary",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Mangalore/nehrus-contributions-to-build-modern-india-immense-padmaraj-poojary/article71702374.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
   "source": "thehindu.com",
   "published": "Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:18:30 +0530",
   "_dt": 1794674910.0,
   "ageDays": 0.04,
   "summary": "Poojary said here on Saturday that former Prime Minister Jawaharlal Nehru’s contribution to building modern India through the initiation of ambitious economic, social and political reforms was immense. Mr. Poojary said Nehru established the Planning Commission and implemented Five-Year Plans to drive the nation’s economic development. He noted that there were ongoing attempts today to obscure the history and contributions of the Nehru family.",
   "summary_zh": "Poojary星期六在此表示，前总理Jawaharlal Nehru通过启动雄心勃勃的经济、社会和政治改革，为建设现代印度作出了巨大贡献。Poojary先生说，Nehru设立了计划委员会，并实施五年计划，以推动国家经济发展。他指出，如今仍有人企图抹杀Nehru家族的历史与贡献。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription President of the Dakshina Kannada Congress Committee Padmaraj R. Poojary said here on Saturday that former Prime Minister Jawaharlal Nehru’s contribution to building modern India through the initiation of ambitious economic, social and political reforms was immense. He was speaking at Nehru Maidan after offering floral tributes to the statue of Nehru on the occasion of his 137th birth anniversary. Mr. Poojary said Nehru established the Planning Commission and implemented Five-Year Plans to drive the nation’s economic development. He prioritised the establishment of heavy industries, steel plants, dams, medical colleges, technical educational institutions, and universities. Most of the country’s IITs and research institutions were built within the first 15 years of India’s Independence. “The fruits of his visionary leadership are being enjoyed not only by the current generation but will also benefit future generations,” he said. He noted that there were ongoing attempts today to obscure the history and contributions of the Nehru family. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
