   "title": "India is no longer functioning as a democracy, destroyed since 2014: Rahul Gandhi",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/india-no-longer-a-democracy-under-bjp-led-regime-rahul-gandhi/article71702053.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
