   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription The College of Defence Management (CDM), Secunderabad, has concluded a four-day ‘Discover India Programme’ for international officers participating in the Higher Defence Management Course-22 (HDMC-22), aimed at providing them with an insight into India’s cultural heritage, history and socio-economic development. The programme was organised as part of CDM’s efforts to strengthen international cooperation and promote defence diplomacy.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁。位于塞康德拉巴德的国防管理学院（CDM）已为参加第22届高级国防管理课程（HDMC-22）的国际军官举办完为期四天的“探索印度”计划，旨在让他们深入了解印度的文化遗产、历史和社会经济发展。该计划是国防管理学院加强国际合作、推动国防外交努力的一部分。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription The College of Defence Management (CDM), Secunderabad, has concluded a four-day ‘Discover India Programme’ for international officers participating in the Higher Defence Management Course-22 (HDMC-22), aimed at providing them with an insight into India’s cultural heritage, history and socio-economic development. The programme was organised as part of CDM’s efforts to strengthen international cooperation and promote defence diplomacy. It offered participating officers an opportunity to understand India’s diverse traditions, governance frameworks and policy initiatives. The initiative sought to foster mutual understanding and strengthen strategic partnerships between India and other countries by familiarising foreign defence officers with the country’s ancient heritage and modern advancements across various sectors. Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
