   "title": "Destinations must move away from volume-driven expansion towards personalised marketing strategies, says Switzerland Tourism CEO",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/destinations-must-move-away-from-volume-driven-expansion-towards-personalised-marketing-strategies-says-switzerland-tourism-ceo/article71645696.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
