   "title": "Bangladesh says legal process complete to secure Hasina’s return, decision rests with India: reports",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/bangladesh-says-legal-process-complete-to-secure-hasinas-return-decision-rests-with-india-reports/article71702012.ece",
