   "title": "Why Does APEC Matter as Trump, Xi and Putin Prepare for a Major Asia-Pacific Summit?",
   "url": "https://moderndiplomacy.eu/2026/11/13/why-does-apec-matter-as-trump-xi-and-putin-prepare-for-a-major-asia-pacific-summit",
