   "title": "How ISWAP’s southern expansion plot was foiled, commander killed in Ondo forest",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/how-iswaps-southern-expansion-plot-was-foiled-commander-killed-in-ondo-forest/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
   "source": "vanguardngr.com",
   "published": "Thu, 12 Nov 2026 05:15:16 +0000",
